==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

